r.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふむ。異論はない。行こう。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00081C|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何? 何の罪だっていうんだ?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081E|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"とぼけるな。貴様を逮捕する。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000820|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"シャーッ。こんなことがあってたまるか。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000822|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"方法は二つだ。自分の足で砦まで一緒に来るか、俺がお前の死体を引きずっていくか。好きな方を選べ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000824|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"分かった、分かった。乱暴はよせ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000839|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よりによって、お前が!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083A|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"やあ、ジャリー・ラ。"},{"form_id":"0x00082C|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"ジャリ・ラ、投獄される"},{"form_id":"0x000836|savetheicerunner.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"ジャリ・ラの復讐"}]